# The Monomachine's side of chain_hold46.spec (`regress.py mmloops ROM` runs it, a part a process): the same
# GND-SIN and controls by MIDI, the tempo on its panel (TEMPO, the LEVEL knob a BPM a detent), each HOLD held
# 4.5 s from its note-on
= t060
assign 0 1
wait 800
midi 176 7 100
midi 176 56 0
midi 176 58 40
midi 176 59 10
midi 176 60 64
midi 176 61 64
midi 176 62 64
midi 176 63 0
midi 176 72 0
midi 176 73 127
midi 176 74 0
midi 176 75 0
midi 176 76 0
midi 176 77 0
midi 176 78 64
midi 176 79 64
midi 176 81 64
midi 176 82 0
midi 176 84 64
midi 176 55 64
wait 1500
tap Tempo
wait 300
enc 8 -60
shot h46_tempo_060
tap Exit
wait 300
midi 176 57 2
wait 400
midi 144 60 100
record 4.5 h46_t060_h002
midi 128 60 0
wait 800
midi 176 57 8
wait 400
midi 144 60 100
record 4.5 h46_t060_h008
midi 128 60 0
wait 800
midi 176 57 32
wait 400
midi 144 60 100
record 4.5 h46_t060_h032
midi 128 60 0
wait 800
midi 176 57 96
wait 400
midi 144 60 100
record 4.5 h46_t060_h096
midi 128 60 0
wait 800
